      "note": [
        "SPIN 2007 is Statistics Swedens classification of goods. The goods are grouped according to the Swedish industrial classification, SIC 2007 (also called SNI). On 4-digit level SPIN corresponds to Eurostats CPA (Classification of Product by Activity). SPIN is not the same as SIC. While SIC is a classification of enterprises into industries SPIN is a classification of goods into industries. Foreign trade for a certain SPIN-code is therefore not the same as foreign trade for companies with the corresponding SIC-code. SPIN 2002, Prod-SNI 97 and Varu-SNI 69 are all predecessors to SPIN 2007, corresponding to SIC 2002, SIC 92 and SIC 69."
      ],
