              "0000025Y": "Volume of exports of goods, index"
            },
            "note": {
              "00000268": [
                "Data on export, import and net trade are revised continuously every month for the last three months. Values are shown in thousands of Swedish krona (SEK) in current prices if nothing else is stated. Weights are shown in metric tons, for some goods other quatities are shown such as cubic meters or pieces. Secrecy in the database is marked with …  \r\n  \r\nFor foreign trade with services see [Balance of Payments (BoP)](www.scb.se/FM0001-en). Companies that import and export below a certain threshold within the EU are not obligated to report their trade statistics. These values and values for companies that have not responded are adjusted when adjusted for non-response is stated. Weight is also adjusted in the same way. Data that is not adjusted is based purely on collected values. These values are therefore underestimated."
              ],
              "0000025Y": [
                "Data on export, import and net trade are revised continuously every month for the last three months. Values are shown in thousands of Swedish krona (SEK) in current prices if nothing else is stated. Weights are shown in metric tons, for some goods other quatities are shown such as cubic meters or pieces. Secrecy in the database is marked with …  \r\nFor foreign trade with services see [Balance of Payments (BoP)](www.scb.se/FM0001-en). Companies that import and export below a certain threshold within the EU are not obligated to report their trade statistics. These values and values for companies that have not responded are adjusted when adjusted for non-response is stated. Weight is also adjusted in the same way. Data that is not adjusted is based purely on collected values. These values are therefore underestimated."
              ]
